@Delgado74 Responding to your suggestion:
* Introducing a NUT-11 lock comes with the expectation that the other device is online, which automatically excludes many of the listed use-cases.
* The NUT-11 spec has been the subject of many issues, so maybe it's worth waiting until we know it's secure.

